# Physical education progression: skills that pass between bands

One file for all grades, so every handoff is written in the csv (assumes and hands_on). These are the ones that cross a band line (rebuilt from the csv after the cold read fixes, 2026-11-19; one line added 2026-11-20, docs/reviews/prework-physical-education-fixes-2026-11-20.md).

## K-2 to 3-5
- g1-heart-muscle gives g3-benefits
- g1-world-games gives g4-world-activities
- g2-overhand-throw gives g3-throw-roll-catch
- g2-long-strike gives g3-strike-tools
- g2-rope-fixed gives g3-rope
- g2-water-skills gives g5-water-skills
- g2-travel-jump-balance gives g3-jump-land-balance, g3-body-roll
- g2-ball-skills-combine gives g3-throw-roll-catch, g3-strike-tools, g3-foot-skills, g3-hand-dribble
- g2-dance-sequence gives g3-dance-steps
- g2-chase-flee gives g3-safe-movement
- g2-show-ideas gives g3-safe-movement, g3-key-parts
- g2-stretch-why gives g3-warm-cool, g3-health-fitness
- g2-foods-energy gives g5-food-drink
- g2-rules-fair gives g3-stay-safe-own
- g2-talk-problems gives g3-kind-groups
- g2-goals gives g3-active-outside
- g2-difficulty-lookback gives g3-express-benefits, g3-calm

## 3-5 to 6-8
- g3-stay-safe-own gives g6-rules-safe
- g4-object-ideas gives g6-analyze-skill
- g4-pulse-body gives g6-heart-rate
- g4-world-activities gives g8-culture-matters
- g4-reasons-strengths gives g6-ways-active
- g5-water-skills gives g8-water
- g5-invasion-skills gives g6-catch-form, g6-pass-receive, g6-dribble, g6-defensive-ready
- g5-net-wall-skills gives g6-strike-net-toward
- g5-strike-field-skills gives g6-throw-roll-form, g6-catch-form, g6-strike-net-toward
- g5-gym-dance-sequence gives g6-dance-sequences
- g5-defend-ideas gives g6-defensive-ready, g6-movement-ideas
- g5-problem-solve gives g6-movement-ideas
- g5-fitt gives g6-health-fitness-technique, g6-skill-fitness-technique, g6-fitness-parts, g6-stretch-types
- g5-food-drink gives g7-eat-move-well
- g5-conflict-solve gives g6-welcome-differences, g7-settle-disagreements
- g5-fair-decisions gives g6-welcome-differences, g6-rules-safe
- g5-goal gives g6-ways-active
- g5-review-experiences gives g6-express-variety, g7-manage-feelings

## 6-8 to 9-12
- g6-analyze-skill gives g9-force-motion
- g7-fitt-principles gives g9-exercise-principles
- g7-effort-aerobic gives g9-effort-heart-rate
- g7-skill-fitness-use gives g10-skill-fitness-training
- g7-rest gives g10-rest
- g7-dance-ideas gives g9-dance-forms
- g7-eat-move-well gives g10-food
- g8-water gives g10-water
- g8-striking-fielding-play gives g9-lifetime-sport-skills
- g8-net-wall-play gives g9-lifetime-sport-skills, g9-casual-rec
- g8-invasion-play gives g9-lifetime-sport-skills, g9-casual-rec
- g8-fitness-dance-apply gives g9-dance-design, g9-aerobic-form, g9-strength-form, g9-dance-forms, g10-skill-fitness-training
- g8-net-wall-tactics gives g9-lifetime-tactics
- g8-strike-field-tactics gives g9-lifetime-tactics
- g8-fitness-test-track gives g9-exercise-principles, g9-effort-heart-rate
- g8-tech-judge gives g10-tech
- g8-outdoor-safety gives g10-safe-habits
- g8-culture-matters gives g10-games-culture
- g8-leading gives g9-courtesy-aware, g9-encourage-feedback
- g8-goals-obstacles gives g9-skill-practice-plan, g9-choose-active
- g8-reflect gives g9-choose-active

