| goal-cycle | Not new: PE K to 2 units 5, 16 (pick, practice, check). SEL 6 to 8 has its own goal steps card (g6-sm-set-goal): PE's cycle stays inside a PE task and names SEL's | Unit 6 (g6-express-variety) | Units 7, 13, 15, 22; goes on to grade 9 |
